clauses=[('Source ID','LIC-17','LIC-17','Unchanged'),('External inference','Not reviewed','Ambiguity logged','Still requires counsel'),('Review owner','Unassigned','Mira Lane (fictional)','Assigned, not approved'),('Execution','None','None','No external call')]
for slug,title,headers,rs,cap in [('rights-table','One source. Five distinct uses.',['Use','Context','Outcome','Condition'],rights,'LIC-17 rights matrix — synthetic'),('change-table','Review progress is not permission.',['Field','Previous sample','Current sample','Meaning'],clauses,'Illustrative metadata comparison — synthetic'),('event-table','Inspect every evaluation.',['ID','Source','Use','Destination','Outcome','Date'],[r[:6] for r in rows],'12 synthetic evaluations — no execution')]:
 cards+=f'<article class="asset wide" data-kind="Tables"><div class="asset-top"><span>Tables / editable HTML</span></div><div class="asset-copy"><h3>{title}</h3>'+table(headers,rs,cap)+'</div></article>'
(d/'visual-brief.md').write_text('''# Visual library contract
Snapshot 08 October 2026. Independent 12-event fixture; do not combine with the main kit 10-event sample. No randomness. No requests executed. Outcomes 4 allow, 4 counsel, 4 deny. Queue age is calendar days to snapshot.

Jobs: compare outcome counts (horizontal bars), inspect open age (dot plot), inspect event volume by day (columns), understand human ownership (swimlanes), distinguish review from approval (diff table), inspect source-specific permissions (matrix), inspect proposed dependencies (left-to-right architecture), understand paused state (state figure), inspect receipt fields (annotated figure), follow expiry coordination (flow).

Renderer: editable original SVG for eight figures, HTML tables for three specimens. Low mark counts; no dependency is needed for simple linear geometry. DOM controls filter assets and evaluation records. Native scrolling; no page scroll hijacking. Mobile retains legible diagrams in locally scrollable regions and puts descriptions immediately below. SVGs contain titles and descriptions. Direct labels and color-independent outcome names; zero baselines. Chart alternatives in the full event table and descriptive text.

Generated art: two original decorative still lifes, never product screenshots or evidence. Analytical labels remain SVG/HTML. Source prompts and provenance delivered. No geographic map because the supplied data has no geography.
''')
